<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Aluar to issue $150 mln in bonds.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Aluar to issue $150 mln in bonds.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine aluminum refiner Aluminio Argentino SAIC (Aluar) said Monday it has approved an issue of $150 million worth of bonds guaranteed by export credits.</p>
<p>The bonds will mature on June 10, 2004 and will accrue monthly interest, Aluar said in a statement to the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>No further details were given.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
